      "public_anchor": "\"\"Twitter post\"; \"quote from Priya Sharma, CTO of Meridian Health\"; \"BrightPath's automation platform cut our onboarding time by 60% and our team couldn't be happier.\"; \"organization ID org_001\"\" from public_input.prompt[1].content",
